      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We need to reframe the issue from short-term cost to long-term strategic advantage for Senator Vance. Focus your talking point on how Section 4b solidifies a competitive domestic manufacturing base, making American energy truly resilient. Emphasize that the initial adjustments are necessary investments that secure decades of local, high-paying manufacturing jobs, directly appealing to his constituency priorities. This narrative shifts the conversation from immediate financial risk to indispensable national economic security.",
      "source": "target",
